{"availability":"available","full":"KaweAW/setlistmaster","name":"setlistmaster","description":"Local-first PWA for bands: setlists, chords and PDF charts that work offline on iPhone, iPad and Mac.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-06T08:36:42Z","updated":"2026-10-10T21:14:40Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://test-scaletta.netlify.app/","topics":["local-first","music","offline-first","pwa","react","setlist","supabase","typescript"],"demo":"https://test-scaletta.netlify.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:10.414Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:10.414Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:10.414Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T19:51:10.414Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Live demo: test-setlistmaster.netlify.app (it opens with an example setlist; nothing leaves your device unless you turn on sharing). The interface is in English by default and can be switched to Italian in Settings.","Scaletta is a setlist app I built for my own cover band. Paper setlists and shared chat threads fall apart on stage: who sings what, which guitar is in drop D, what comes next without a pause. Here the setlist, the chord charts and the stage view live in one installable app that keeps working with no signal at all, and the band can optionally share everything live.","Song lines in the pictures are invented or blurred; Scaletta never ships lyrics or chords."],"features":["Setlists in blocks, with drag and drop, transitions (\"direct segue\", \"hard stop\"), who sings each song, and alternate tunings.","Song library with search and filters, chord charts in ChordPro or chords-over-words, transposition and capo.","Instrument parts: every song has its plain text, and each instrument (lead, rhythm, bass, piano… you edit the list) can have its own chart, opening on the instrument you play.","PDF charts attached to songs (several per part, picked from a list), viewed offline.","Stage mode: dark screen, large text, screen kept awake, auto-scroll, no editing buttons."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/KaweAW/setlistmaster/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"5f01b32c0c31bcc07f455b4976a26e8dc8876f1ff8ac951c91a3444b9239de94","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:10.540Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:10.540Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Live demo: test-setlistmaster.netlify.app (it opens with an example setlist; nothing leaves your device unless you turn on sharing). The interface is in English by default and can be switched to Italian in Settings.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/KaweAW/setlistmaster/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"Scaletta is a setlist app I built for my own cover band. Paper setlists and shared chat threads fall apart on stage: who sings what, which guitar is in drop D, what comes next without a pause. Here the setlist, the chord charts and the stage view live in one installable app that keeps working with no signal at all, and the band can optionally share everything live.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/KaweAW/setlistmaster/blob/main/README.md"}],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"src/cloud/ – Supabase client, sign-in and band sharing.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/KaweAW/setlistmaster/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"In the app: Settings > Sharing and sync > create an account > \"Share this band\" > \"Invite\".","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/KaweAW/setlistmaster/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"5f01b32c0c31bcc07f455b4976a26e8dc8876f1ff8ac951c91a3444b9239de94","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/KaweAW/setlistmaster/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:10.540Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-10T21:14:40Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/KaweAW/setlistmaster/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026